    <ol>
      <li><b>PMA soup on the last N pretrain ckpts</b> (<code>scripts/pma_average.py</code>, ready). 500M v2 fast has 8 ckpts on disk, all inside the flat plateau (val_ppl 15.03-15.07, memory-Δ +30.24-+30.39) — ideal soup window.  <em>Ran on the initial post-pretrain pipeline; result was null (see Recent Completions). Re-run only after Test 2 resolves budget-vs-ceiling.</em></li>
      <li><b>MQAR refine</b> (+50M tok, ~3255 steps). Config <code>configs/mqar_refine_500m.yaml</code>. <em>Ran, came back null. Test 2 (<code>mqar_refine_500m_strong.yaml</code>, 4&times; budget) currently running to settle budget-vs-ceiling.</em></li>
      <li><b>Sparsity refine</b> (+50M tok, ~3255 steps). Config <code>configs/sparsity_refine_500m.yaml</code>. <em>Ran, came back null (spike didn't move from 0.069 toward 0.05). Now optional given the already-below-original-target starting point.</em></li>
      <li><b>β telemetry watch</b> throughout both refines — every eval line prints <code>[beta] blkN: μ=... dead=X%</code>. dead_frac climbing on any block during refine = stop and investigate; delta-rule pathway losing its grip.</li>
      <li><b>LoRA-SFT</b> (<code>configs/sft_30m_lora.yaml</code> as template; needs a <code>sft_500m_lora.yaml</code> variant sized for the 500M base) — parameter-efficient SFT via <code>src/lora.py</code>. Produces a tiny <code>adapter_step_*.pt</code> instead of a full-model copy.</li>
      <li><b>Merge LoRA-SFT adapter</b> (<code>scripts/merge_lora_ckpt.py</code>) → plain merged ckpt to feed into DPO.</li>
