  <li class="done"><b>SDM design doc landed 2026-07-12</b> (<a href="sdm_design.md"><code>docs/sdm_design.md</code></a>). Full paper mapping into our layout (PKM outer-sum addressing in O(√N), per-slot gated delta write on top-W indices, read from top-R indices), composition matrix vs existing wins, 30M/500M sizing plan, 8-phase build plan with fracconn-style identity-init verification gate BEFORE any GPU, risk register.</li>
  <li class="done"><b>Overnight chain launched 2026-07-12 00:39</b> (<code>temp/chain_5080_overnight.sh</code>, <code>temp/chain_5090_overnight.sh</code>): 5080 seed0 control &rarr; seed1 control (seed0 done 00:58, seed1 fired automatically). 5090 first-ever <b>NorMuon + Engram-v2 combined 30M validation</b> (seed0 running, memory-Δ +168.93 at step 3000 — biggest single-eval memory-pathway signal this project has ever produced). Bulletproof file-based chains (pgrep-polled, no in-memory state, robust to WSL restart).</li>
