  <li class="done"><b>NorMuon A/B — CONFIRMED (2026-07-11).</b> Two bugs found+fixed along the way (YAML sci-notation string footgun; missing global-renorm causing ~45&times; update inflation/divergence — see <code>neuro_normuon_renorm_fix.md</code>). Final: NorMuon 85.61 vs Muon control 86.69 — real but modest quality win (−1.1 ppl), 28% SLOWER wall-clock (3.32h vs 2.59h); does not match the paper's "+15%, ~3% overhead" claim at this scale. Include in the 350M bake for quality, not speed.</li>
